                    are prepared for the product introduction.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Readiness planning should evaluate product quality, performance,
                    security, documentation, infrastructure, customer onboarding,
                    support processes, marketing materials, sales training, and
                    communication requirements.
                </p>

                <p>
                    A structured readiness review helps organizations identify
                    outstanding issues before launch and establish clear criteria
                    for determining whether the product is ready to be released.
                </p>
