                    appropriate responses. Risks may involve product quality,
                    technical infrastructure, dependencies, resources, customer
                    support, communication, market readiness, or external factors.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Teams can maintain a launch risk register that documents the
                    potential impact, likelihood, owner, mitigation approach, and
                    contingency plan for important risks.
                </p>

                <p>
                    For high-impact risks, clear escalation paths and decision
                    criteria should be established so that teams can respond quickly
                    if an issue occurs during the launch.
