                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Issue Resolution:</b> Monitor the number and severity of unresolved launch blockers and risks.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Customer Adoption:</b> Measure how quickly customers adopt the newly launched product or capabilities.</p>
